  "summary": "2019 Honda Odyssey forward collision avoidance/adaptive cruise control multipurpose camera works intermittently; five orange warnings within 60 seconds of startup, works on first cool morning drive, possible camera overheating, BRAKE SYSTEM light stays on.",
  "group": "adas",
  "symptoms": [
    "multipurpose camera works intermittently",
    "five bright orange warning lights come on within 60 seconds of startup",
    "Adaptive Cruise Control Failure warning",
    "Collision Mitigation System Failure warning",
    "Lane Keeping Assistance Problem warning",
    "Road Departure Assistance Problem warning",
    "Auto-High Beam failure warning",
    "BRAKE SYSTEM light stays illuminated orange"
  ],
